Governance: Naming & Tags

NAMING
NAME-001/002 · Hard Fail · Campaign/Canvas name format:
YYYYMMDD_Name-Extra_type_channel_locale
· YYYYMMDD = launch date in Braze. Not visible = To Be Checked
· type: evergreen (no end date) | oneoff (end date set)
· channel: email|push|sms|inapp|contentcard|webhook|multichannel
· locale: ISO code (en-US) or global. Must match tag.locale

NAME-003 · Hard Fail (duplicate/missing index) · Warn (generic description)
Canvas step format: {##}__channel__description
· ## = 2-digit sequential index across ALL steps in Canvas
· channel: email|push|sms|inapp|contentcard|delay|decision|webhook|action_path|audience_split|experiment_path|multichannel
· description: snake_case, meaningful. Generic = Warn. Braze defaults = Hard Fail

