Description field is empty (shows "+ Add description" placeholder)
Fix:Add meaningful description

TAGS
TAG-001 · Hard Fail · All 6 required tags must be present, format tag.[key]=[value]
· tag.env=prod|staging|test
· tag.region=[lowercase]
· tag.team=[snake_case]
· tag.channel=[channel]
· tag.owner=[snake_case slug]
· tag.program=[snake_case slug]

TAG-002 · Hard Fail if condition met but tag absent · Conditional tags:
· Scheduled → tag.trigger=scheduled
· Action-based → tag.trigger=event
· API-triggered → tag.trigger=api
· Localised → tag.locale=[ISO]. Must match name locale
· A/B test → tag.test=ab
· Experiment Paths → tag.test=experiment
· tag.test present, no test running → Warn

TAG-003 · Hard Fail · Forbidden tags:
· Exact: old-team-tag, misc, temp
· Any tag not starting with tag.

TAG-004 · Warn · Allowed extras only:
tag.ticket|tag.jira|tag.lifecycle|tag.objective|tag.exception=true
· If tag.exception=true → description must contain "Exception approved by NAME on YYYY-MM-DD: REASON". Missing = To Be Checked

TOK-001 · Hard Fail · All name fields: snake_case and allowed characters only
